#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:4
#: 52d08e68b7e24dfcb8470b4146e2f974
msgid "QuadPlane Simulation"
msgstr "四旋翼飞机仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:6
#: 4ef71174676543299b16b59ccdb1cea1
msgid ""
"A simple QuadPlane model is available in SITL, allowing you to test the "
"features of the QuadPlane code without risking a real aircraft."
msgstr "SITL 中提供了一个简单的四旋翼飞机模型，让您无需冒险使用真实飞机即可测试四旋翼飞机代码的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:9
#: b61453e6332e487e962c5e456f973016
msgid "You can start it like this, from any vehicle's subdirectory:"
msgstr "您可以从任意飞行器的子目录中如下启动："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:20
#: 00e405683f62478cb05a2eaf84b8264d
msgid ""
"If you have simulated other vehicles in the current directory, you may wish "
"to add the - w option to the command line to reset the parameters back to "
"QuadPlane defaults (normal Separate Lift Thrust (SLT) QuadPlane in quad "
"configuration)."
msgstr ""
"如果您在当前目录中模拟了其他飞行器，您可能希望在命令行添加 -w "
"选项，将参数重置回四旋翼飞机默认值（标准分离升力推力（SLT）四旋翼配置的四旋翼飞机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:24
#: cc248a2ea06e45b1a626bae6b835aed0
msgid ""
"To visualise the aircraft you can use FlightGear in view-only mode. The "
"simulation will output FlightGear compatible state on UDP port 5503. Start "
"FlightGear using the **fg_plane_view.sh** scripts provided in the "
"**Tools/autotest** directory."
msgstr ""
"要可视化飞行器，您可以使用 FlightGear 的仅查看模式。仿真将在 UDP 端口 5503 上输出 FlightGear 兼容状态。使用 "
"**Tools/autotest** 目录中提供的 **fg_plane_view.sh** 脚本启动 FlightGear。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:29
#: 985ff1aa8f0b4a7ab743965abcf2da3b
msgid ""
"Note that to get good scenery for FlightGear it is best to use a major "
"airport. I tend to test at San Francisco airport, like this:"
msgstr "请注意，为了获得 FlightGear 的良好场景，最好使用主要机场。我通常在旧金山机场进行测试，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:36
#: e756f7895c28430b8a885b9a7746b0dd
msgid ""
"Using the joystick module with a USB adapter for your transmitter gives a "
"convenient way to get used to the QuadPlane controls before flying."
msgstr "使用带 USB 适配器的操纵杆模块连接遥控器，是在飞行前熟悉四旋翼飞机控制的便捷方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:39
#: 600ac969e42b455682191161d4e7665a
msgid ""
"If flying at KSFO there is a sample mission available with VTOL takeoff and "
"landing:"
msgstr "如果在 KSFO 飞行，有一个包含 VTOL 起飞和降落的示例任务可用："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-simulation.rst:46
#: d1d8f052b32d49fbbd401c9d32c50783
msgid "As usual you can edit the mission using \"module load misseditor\""
msgstr "像往常一样，您可以使用 「module load misseditor」 编辑任务"
